    "id": "c1",
    "startMs": 200,
    "endMs": 5600,
    "text": "Unit 3. Exercise for listening."
  },
  {
    "id": "c2",
    "startMs": 6360,
    "endMs": 6900,
    "text": "2 million C."
  },
  {
    "id": "c3",
    "startMs": 7560,
    "endMs": 9320,
    "text": "1. Listen and choose."
  },
  {
    "id": "c4",
    "startMs": 10280,
    "endMs": 11240,
    "text": "2. You and your Shama."
  },
  {
    "id": "c5",
    "startMs": 11780,
    "endMs": 12500,
    "text": "You can choose 10,000."
  },
  {
    "id": "c6",
    "startMs": 13140,
    "endMs": 16760,
    "text": "1. Look!"
  },
  {
    "id": "c7",
    "startMs": 18240,
    "endMs": 19680,
    "text": "That plant has special leaves,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c8",
    "startMs": 20320,
    "endMs": 21980,
    "text": "like a mouth with many teeth."
  },
  {
    "id": "c9",
    "startMs": 25440,
    "endMs": 29000,
    "text": "2. The flowers grow from the mud under the water."
  },
  {
    "id": "c10",
    "startMs": 31960,
    "endMs": 35760,
    "text": "3. We eat roots such as carrots."
  },
  {
    "id": "c11",
    "startMs": 39290,
    "endMs": 43140,
    "text": "4. The flowers grow fruits with seeds inside."
  },
  {
    "id": "c12",
    "startMs": 46580,
    "endMs": 48160,
    "text": "5. Wow,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c13",
    "startMs": 48760,
    "endMs": 50720,
    "text": "these morning glories open up."
  },
  {
    "id": "c14",
    "startMs": 52700,
    "endMs": 55160,
    "text": "2. Listen and match."
  },
  {
    "id": "c15",
    "startMs": 65540,
    "endMs": 66340,
    "text": "First,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c16",
    "startMs": 66480,
    "endMs": 69580,
    "text": "we'll visit the Rose Garden to see the beautiful flowers."
  },
  {
    "id": "c17",
    "startMs": 71740,
    "endMs": 75280,
    "text": "Then we'll stop at the pond to observe the water lilies."
  },
  {
    "id": "c18",
    "startMs": 77100,
    "endMs": 77520,
    "text": "After that,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c19",
    "startMs": 78040,
    "endMs": 81560,
    "text": "we'll look around the creeper section to see how plants climb walls."
  },
  {
    "id": "c20",
    "startMs": 83190,
    "endMs": 83840,
    "text": "Next,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c21",
    "startMs": 84340,
    "endMs": 86480,
    "text": "we'll go to the greenhouse to learn about plants."
  },
  {
    "id": "c22",
    "startMs": 88660,
    "endMs": 89080,
    "text": "Finally,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c23",
    "startMs": 89760,
    "endMs": 92180,
    "text": "we'll relax in the shade of a big pine tree."
  },
  {
    "id": "c24",
    "startMs": 94420,
    "endMs": 95220,
    "text": "First,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c25",
    "startMs": 95320,
    "endMs": 98420,
    "text": "we'll visit the rose garden to see the beautiful flowers."
  },
  {
    "id": "c26",
    "startMs": 100660,
    "endMs": 100800,
    "text": "Then,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c27",
    "startMs": 101340,
    "endMs": 104040,
    "text": "we'll stop at the pond to observe the water lilies."
  },
  {
    "id": "c28",
    "startMs": 105920,
    "endMs": 106340,
    "text": "After that,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c29",
    "startMs": 106880,
    "endMs": 110400,
    "text": "we'll look around the creeper section to see how plants climb walls."
  },
  {
    "id": "c30",
    "startMs": 112060,
    "endMs": 112660,
    "text": "Next,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c31",
    "startMs": 113180,
    "endMs": 115320,
    "text": "we'll go to the greenhouse to learn about plants."
  },
  {
    "id": "c32",
    "startMs": 117680,
    "endMs": 117940,
    "text": "Finally,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c33",
    "startMs": 117970,
    "endMs": 121060,
    "text": "we'll relax in the shade of a big pine tree."
  },
  {
    "id": "c34",
    "startMs": 122960,
    "endMs": 123860,
    "text": "3."
  },
  {
    "id": "c35",
    "startMs": 124540,
    "endMs": 125280,
    "text": "Listen and judge."
  },
  {
    "id": "c36",
    "startMs": 126260,
    "endMs": 129140,
    "text": "São Pósá tían há sá tían zá jó yan zang guan,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c37",
    "startMs": 129600,
    "endMs": 130080,
    "text": "hí nó yían,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c38",
    "startMs": 130500,
    "endMs": 131960,
    "text": "pán tó pían só fó yó"
  },
  {
    "id": "c39",
    "startMs": 131960,
    "endMs": 133160,
    "text": "lú yí né róng são fó,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c40",
    "startMs": 133680,
    "endMs": 135140,
    "text": "são fó de yóng são lían bá sí,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c41",
    "startMs": 135640,
    "endMs": 137660,
    "text": "fó de yóng kó lían bá sí."
  },
  {
    "id": "c42",
    "startMs": 140200,
    "endMs": 143520,
    "text": "1. A meat-eating plant has special leaves."
  },
  {
    "id": "c43",
    "startMs": 144580,
    "endMs": 145920,
    "text": "It eats small animals."
  },
  {
    "id": "c44",
    "startMs": 149040,
    "endMs": 152600,
    "text": "2. The creekers have long thin stems."
  },
  {
    "id": "c45",
    "startMs": 153540,
    "endMs": 155260,
    "text": "They can grow all over a wall."
  },
  {
    "id": "c46",
    "startMs": 158110,
    "endMs": 164170,
    "text": "3. The water lilies' big leaves look like lovely green umbrellas."
  },
  {
    "id": "c47",
    "startMs": 166800,
    "endMs": 171140,
    "text": "4. You can see different animals in the botanical garden."
  },
  {
    "id": "c48",
    "startMs": 174470,
    "endMs": 179300,
    "text": "5. An ice cream tulip looks like an ice cream cone."
  },
  {
    "id": "c49",
    "startMs": 179940,
    "endMs": 180420,
    "text": "How lovely."
  },
  {
    "id": "c50",
    "startMs": 183670,
    "endMs": 186520,
    "text": "4. Listen, choose and write."
  },
  {
    "id": "c51",
    "startMs": 201580,
    "endMs": 203840,
    "text": "We are going to talk about the weather."
  },
  {
    "id": "c52",
    "startMs": 204120,
    "endMs": 204520,
    "text": "Today,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c53",
    "startMs": 205660,
    "endMs": 209300,
    "text": "we are going to learn about how some plants can forecast the weather."
  },
  {
    "id": "c54",
    "startMs": 210580,
    "endMs": 213460,
    "text": "First, let's talk about pine cones."
  },
  {
    "id": "c55",
    "startMs": 214740,
    "endMs": 217260,
    "text": "On dry days pine cones are open."
  },
  {
    "id": "c56",
    "startMs": 218500,
    "endMs": 221380,
    "text": "This is because the dry air makes them spread out."
  },
  {
    "id": "c57",
    "startMs": 222420,
    "endMs": 222660,
    "text": "However,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c58",
    "startMs": 223220,
    "endMs": 226020,
    "text": "on rainy days pine cones close."
  },
  {
    "id": "c59",
    "startMs": 227580,
    "endMs": 230620,
    "text": "They do this to protect the seeds inside from getting wet."
  },
  {
    "id": "c60",
    "startMs": 232720,
    "endMs": 232940,
    "text": "Next,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c61",
    "startMs": 233820,
    "endMs": 235140,
    "text": "let's discuss dandelions."
  },
  {
    "id": "c62",
    "startMs": 236580,
    "endMs": 239840,
    "text": "When the air is dry the fluff of dandelions is very fluffy"
  },
  {
    "id": "c63",
    "startMs": 240620,
    "endMs": 242760,
    "text": "and easy to be blown away by the wind,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c64",
    "startMs": 243560,
    "endMs": 245280,
    "text": "but when it's going to rain,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c65",
    "startMs": 246160,
    "endMs": 246840,
    "text": "the fluff becomes"
  },
  {
    "id": "c66",
    "startMs": 246840,
    "endMs": 249920,
    "text": "wet and heavy and it doesn't fly away easily."
  },
  {
    "id": "c67",
    "startMs": 251080,
    "endMs": 251320,
    "text": "So,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c68",
    "startMs": 251960,
    "endMs": 254480,
    "text": "by looking at Dandelion's fluff, we can"
  },
  {
    "id": "c69",
    "startMs": 254640,
    "endMs": 256660,
    "text": "also get some clues about the weather."
  },
  {
    "id": "c70",
    "startMs": 257720,
    "endMs": 258760,
    "text": "Lastly,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c71",
    "startMs": 259860,
    "endMs": 260780,
    "text": "let's talk about cabbage."
  },
  {
    "id": "c72",
    "startMs": 262200,
    "endMs": 262900,
    "text": "The leaves of cabbage"
  },
  {
    "id": "c73",
    "startMs": 262900,
    "endMs": 264780,
    "text": "can tell us about the weather too."
  },
  {
    "id": "c74",
    "startMs": 266020,
    "endMs": 267060,
    "text": "If the leaves are spread out,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c75",
    "startMs": 268160,
    "endMs": 269120,
    "text": "it usually means the"
  },
  {
    "id": "c76",
    "startMs": 269140,
    "endMs": 269880,
    "text": "weather is good."
  },
  {
    "id": "c77",
    "startMs": 271060,
    "endMs": 273420,
    "text": "But if the leaves are rolled up tightly,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c78",
    "startMs": 274060,
    "endMs": 275660,
    "text": "it may tell us that rain is coming."
  },
  {
    "id": "c79",
    "startMs": 277220,
    "endMs": 278460,
    "text": "That's all for today's introduction."
  },
  {
    "id": "c80",
    "startMs": 279720,
    "endMs": 281600,
    "text": "I hope you've learned something new about plants"
  },
  {
    "id": "c81",
    "startMs": 281600,
    "endMs": 282800,
    "text": "and weather forecasting."
  },
  {
    "id": "c82",
